<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GOLD COAST CLASSIC QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GOLD COAST, Australia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results in the Gold Coast Classic women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Elena Likhovtseva (Russia) beat Rachel McQuillan 3-6 6-3 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>6-Ai Sugiyama (Japan) beat 4-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-2 3-6 7-6 (7-0)</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Asa Carlsson (Sweden) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>1-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) v Maria Luisa Serna (Spain) postponed</p>
</text>
